      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenClicky 音量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Controls spoken reply playback without changing macOS system volume.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只控制语音回复音量,不影响 macOS 系统音量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Caption every spoken response": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回复文字气泡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows OpenClicky's spoken reply beside the cursor while voice playback runs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "语音回复时在光标旁显示文字气泡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Circle while talking": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "说话时圈选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold push-to-talk, then click and drag a red trail around something while speaking. On release, the region goes with your instruction to voice and Agent Mode.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住说话时,可用鼠标拖出红色圈选。松开后区域会随语音指令送入 Agent Mode。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Click and drag to draw": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点击并拖动来圈选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On (default): click and drag while holding the key. Off: any mouse movement while holding the key draws.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启(默认): 按住热键 + 点击拖动。关闭: 按住热键时任意鼠标移动都会绘制。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test caption playback": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测试文字气泡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Realtime bypasses local STT": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Realtime 绕过本地识别"
          }
        }
