      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示 OpenClicky"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi, I'm Jason. This is OpenClicky.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你好,我是 Jason,这是 OpenClicky。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A side project I made for fun to help me learn stuff as I use my computer.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个我做着玩的副业项目,帮我在用电脑时学到东西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask naturally. OpenClicky handles quick voice and computer-use requests itself, and hands deeper research, writing, coding, or file work to an agent in the background.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自然提问。OpenClicky 会自己处理快速语音与 Computer Use 请求,并把更深入的研究、写作、编程或文件工作交给后台 Agent。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ask OpenClicky about anything on your screen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于屏幕上的一切,尽管问 OpenClicky。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Also, you can press Control twice to enter text mode.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "另外,连按两下 Control 键可进入文本输入模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hold": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "We're set": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "准备就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permissions needed": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需要权限"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Permissions are ready. Start OpenClicky now, then choose local voice or agent provider details in Settings when you want them.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "权限已就绪。现在可以启动 OpenClicky,之后在 Settings 里再选择本地语音或 Agent 服务细节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some permissions were revoked. Grant all four below to keep using OpenClicky.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "部分权限已撤销。请授予下方权限以继续使用 OpenClicky。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing runs in the background. OpenClicky will only take a screenshot when you press the hot key. So, you can give that permission in peace. If you are still sus, eh, I can't do much there champ.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenClicky 不会在后台运行任何东西。只有按下热键时才会截图,所以放心授权。若仍有顾虑,只能理解你了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
