    "Pick OpenClicky’s cursor buddy and accent color. Pets ignore the color tint, but the accent still drives glows, buttons, and task badges.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择 OpenClicky 的光标伙伴与强调色。宠物不会应用色调,但强调色仍会影响光晕、按钮和任务标识。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick Realtime when one model should listen and speak live, or use a normal model when OpenClicky should think first and hand the reply to a playback engine.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择 Realtime 让同一模型实时收听与说话;或使用普通模型,让 OpenClicky 先思考再交给播放引擎朗读。"
          }
        }
