            "state": "translated",
            "value": "值越高越需要更响亮/清晰的语音才能触发。若环境噪声误触发,请调高。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install the openclicky-voice skill into each CLI agent you use. In SKI Mode, OpenClicky writes your speech to `.oc/events.jsonl` in the active project and the CLI agent replies through `.oc/commands.jsonl`. Nothing is written to a CLI agent's home directory without your explicit click.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将 openclicky-voice 技能安装到你使用的每个 CLI Agent。在 SKI Mode 下,OpenClicky 会把语音写入活动项目的 `.oc/events.jsonl`,CLI Agent 通过 `.oc/commands.jsonl` 回复。未经明确点击不会向 CLI Agent 主目录写入任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
