    "Describe the camera scene. Identify people, objects, the setting, visible actions, and anything unusual or important.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "描述摄像头场景。识别人物、物体、环境、可见动作以及任何异常或重要事项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scan text": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "扫描文本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read any visible text in the camera image. Extract names, labels, prices, codes, dates, warnings, addresses, or other important information.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取摄像头图像中的任何可见文本。提取名称、标签、价格、编码、日期、警告、地址或其他重要信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identify objects": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "识别物体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identify the objects and items shown. For each important item, say what it likely is, how confident you are, and what details support the identification.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "识别显示的物体和物品。对每个重要物品,说明其可能是什么、置信度如何以及支持识别的细节。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lookup items": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "查询物品"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Identify any products, devices, books, documents, logos, or notable objects shown. Give likely names, useful search terms, distinguishing details, and what I should verify if I look them up.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
